<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH C-BANK TO RELEASE BANK PLAN DETAILS 1100 GMT.</title>
<headline>CZECH C-BANK TO RELEASE BANK PLAN DETAILS 1100 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said it would release details of a plan to strengthen the stability of small domestic private banks at a news conference scheduled for 1 pm (1100 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
</text>
